 "response": "I will submit initial compliant bids for all eligible lots using unit prices set at our synchronized standard cost plus a 12% margin to ensure sustainable profitability. Delivery selected: 6-week lead time; Warranty: 24 months; Payment: Net 30 days (buyer’s allowed options). These bids reflect our confirmed production capacity for the tender period and meet the published technical specifications. All prices and terms are truthful and supportable by our systems; I will monitor the auction and adjust within allowed ranges only if we can preserve the minimum margin and capacity constraints."
